Raw interet data -> Pre-training( millions of GPUs) -> Base Foundation Model

What actual a base model:
-> It is the master of language and general reasoning. It knows what a noun is and how to speak english, genral world history and basic logic.

What is base model is not:
it does not know the company privalte rules, dosnt follow prefered formatinmg reliably, it can do expensive / slow for high volume of task. it can stumble on multy - step reasoning.


To fix this gaps we no need to rebulid the model for zero, We can custiomize it. Amazon bedrock provides three layers ways to do this:

1.Supervised Fine - Tuning(SFT)
2. reinforcement Fine-Tuning(RFT)
3.Model Distillation

